#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:1
msgid "美术风格"
msgstr "Art Style"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:3
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;灵数奇缘项目美术设计的主意是源于对我们自己中式文化的喜爱，而想到什么是中式文化的形象时，我们想到的不是常见的具体文化符号和意向，而是华夏文明的范畴，即在中国这片土地上一直茁壮成长并流传至今的文化总和，其中即包括了不那么常见的中华少数民族创造的文化符号和意向。目前少数民族聚居地区，目前主要还是多集中于相对较为贫困的乡村和山区，那些拥有璀璨而独特的文化遗产的人们，理应是过上越发幸福的生活的。所以我们的社区也在想能不能应用不同的创作力，创新展现少数民族文化作品的制作方式、内容形式制作成文化产品。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;The art design concept of the Luv Sense Digital project stems"
" from our love for our own Chinese culture. When thinking about what "
"represents Chinese cultural imagery, we don't think of the common "
"specific cultural symbols and motifs, but rather the broader scope of "
"Huaxia civilization — the totality of cultures that have thrived and been"
" passed down to this day on the land of China, including the less "
"commonly seen cultural symbols and motifs created by ethnic minorities of"
" China. Currently, ethnic minority areas are still mostly concentrated in"
" relatively impoverished rural and mountainous regions. Those people who "
"possess brilliant and unique cultural heritage deserve to live "
"increasingly happy lives. Therefore, our community also wonders whether "
"we can apply different creative forces to innovatively present ethnic "
"minority cultural works through new production methods and content "
"formats as cultural products."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:5
msgid "《灵数奇缘》新国风设计尝试"
msgstr "Luv Sense Digital's New Chinese Style Design Experiment"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:7
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;在遵循团队的创作初心下，我们尝试了做一个“赛博朋克元素+傣族小姐姐”的角色设计。和画师伙伴们商量后，定下了制作流程，先是完成游戏世界观的文案设定，然后进行世界观下的角色人设文案设计，再与画师讨论创作设定稿，最后再制作游戏供中使用的人物立绘以及Q版形象。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Staying true to the team's original creative vision, we "
"attempted a character design combining \"cyberpunk elements + Dai ethnic "
"girl.\" After discussing with our artist partners, we established the "
"production workflow: first completing the game worldbuilding setting "
"documents, then designing character profiles within that world, then "
"discussing and creating concept designs with the artists, and finally "
"producing character illustrations and chibi forms for use in the game."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:9
msgid "Step 1 编写文案"
msgstr "Step 1: Writing the Story"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:11
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;为了创作游戏角色“玉”，开始编写的设定文案如下："
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;To create the game character \"Yu,\" the following setting "
"document was written:"

