#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md
msgid "盘发、表情高冷、皮肤白皙、身着傣族公主般的服饰，身后有一尊悬浮的佛陀造型有多只手臂的战斗机器人（感觉类似jojo里的替身），机器人生成保护性的能量护罩看起来就像在发出金光。下面的两只手臂会摆成托举的座椅，变成临时承载玉行动的坐骑。遇到危险的时候，佛陀机器人会挥舞手臂进行攻击，或是操作各式攻击武器。"
msgstr ""
"Hair in a bun, aloof expression, fair skin, dressed in Dai princess-style"
" attire. Behind her is a hovering Buddha-shaped combat robot with "
"multiple arms (similar to a Stand from JoJo's Bizarre Adventure). The "
"robot generates a protective energy shield that appears to emit golden "
"light. Its lower two arms can form a lifting seat, becoming a temporary "
"mount for Yu's movement. When encountering danger, the Buddha robot "
"swings its arms to attack or operates various offensive weapons."

