#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:39
msgid "Step 2 进行美术设计"
msgstr "Step 2: Art Design"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:41
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;担任概念设计的大西老师以自己对傣族文化的理解，根据文案，以体现角色具有异能的特点为主，结合傣族的图腾孔雀以及小成佛教的形象做了初稿的设计。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Teacher Daxi, serving as concept designer, drew upon his own "
"understanding of Dai ethnic culture and, based on the story documents, "
"created the initial draft design primarily emphasizing the character's "
"supernatural abilities, combined with the Dai totem of the peacock and "
"Theravada Buddhist imagery."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:44
msgid "玉 v1"
msgstr "Yu v1"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:48
msgid "初稿的玉，主题为异能和人工造物（by：周大西）"
msgstr ""
"Initial draft of Yu, themed around supernatural powers and artificial "
"creation (by: Zhou Daxi)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:51
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;有了具象的创作，大家就一起参与美术设计细节的讨论。最后认为服饰上的傣家文化元素没有体现出来，可以增加傣族特有的佛塔的头饰，以及修改为被叫做“隆基”的特别款式的包臀长裙。以及结合游戏玩法，设定中的人物和守护者机器人会同时出现在游戏里，人物大小比例应该能同时容纳在游戏场景里。于是融合大家的意见大西老师做了下一版的修改。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;With a concrete creation in hand, everyone participated in "
"discussing the art design details together. It was ultimately decided "
"that the Dai cultural elements in the clothing were not prominent enough."
" They could add the distinctive Dai Buddhist pagoda headdress and modify "
"the outfit to a special style of hip-wrapping long skirt called "
"\"Longji.\" Also, considering gameplay, the character and guardian robot "
"in the design would appear simultaneously in the game, so the character "
"size proportions should fit together within the game scene. Incorporating"
" everyone's opinions, Teacher Daxi made revisions for the next version."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:54
msgid "玉 v2"
msgstr "Yu v2"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:58
msgid "第二版的玉，更加融合傣族元素（by：周大西）"
msgstr ""
"Second version of Yu, with more integrated Dai ethnic elements (by: Zhou "
"Daxi)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:61
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;完成这一版后民族元素有所增加，可是总感觉还是有些缺少特色，仿佛只是把传统少数民族的文化形象简单地搬到了我们的作品里。又回想我们的创作初心，“新国风”与“融合”。所谓的“国风”应该体现在哪里呢？一番头脑风暴后，大家终于发现了问题。在中国古代的传统文化意象中，“人的造物”往往都是有美好意蕴，并且通常是会为人们的生活带来更多幸福的。不同于西方文化中观念，比如人造之人“弗兰肯斯坦”的故事带来就是悲剧和灾难。大西老师也告诉了大家他心中最初的意象，确实有人造之物会带来灾难的思考，比如初版人物的头发也有章鱼触手的设计，也是希望给人以有危险的形象感。于是大家再次统一了想法，如果以比较“中式”的思维重新做思考，这个人的造物的形象应该是什么样的呢？"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;首先“玉”是集合众人自发的无私贡献的力量创造的造物，那她应该是寄托了众人的美好愿望而生，圣洁而美丽的公主。因为是傣家的少女，那么傣族文化中圣洁的形象，那对应的就是金孔雀的图腾形象了。而金孔雀形象的参考，最知名的演绎就在艺术家杨丽萍的孔雀舞中。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;After completing this version, the ethnic elements had "
"increased, but there was still a feeling that something distinctive was "
"missing — as if traditional ethnic minority cultural imagery had simply "
"been transplanted into our work. Recalling our original creative vision "
"of \"New Chinese Style\" and \"Fusion,\" where should this \"Chinese "
"style\" be reflected? After a brainstorming session, everyone finally "
"identified the problem. In ancient Chinese traditional cultural imagery, "
"\"human creations\" often carry beautiful meanings and usually bring more"
" happiness to people's lives. This differs from Western cultural "
"concepts, where stories like the man-made being \"Frankenstein\" bring "
"tragedy and disaster. Teacher Daxi also shared his original imagery with "
"everyone — there was indeed contemplation about man-made things bringing "
"disaster. For example, the initial version's character had octopus "
"tentacle designs in the hair, intended to give a sense of danger. So "
"everyone unified their thinking once more: if we rethink with a more "
"\"Chinese-style\" mindset, what should this human creation look like?   "
"&emsp;&emsp;First, \"Yu\" is a creation born from the collective power of"
" people's spontaneous and selfless contributions, so she should be a "
"sacred and beautiful princess embodying everyone's beautiful wishes. "
"Since she is a Dai ethnic girl, the sacred image in Dai culture would "
"correspond to the golden peacock totem. And the most famous "
"interpretation of the golden peacock image is found in artist Yang "
"Liping's peacock dance."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:65
msgid "杨丽萍-孔雀舞"
msgstr "Yang Liping - Peacock Dance"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:69
msgid "杨丽萍的孔雀舞"
msgstr "Yang Liping's Peacock Dance"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:72
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;于是怀着众人愿望而生，受到神灵感召而生的机械守护者保护的，圣洁又身怀异能的孔雀公主终于被重新设计了出来。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;And so, born from the wishes of the people, protected by a "
"mechanical guardian born from divine inspiration, the sacred peacock "
"princess endowed with supernatural powers was finally redesigned."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:75
msgid "玉 v3"
msgstr "Yu v3"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:79
msgid "最终版玉的人设（by：周大西）"
msgstr "Final version of Yu's character design (by: Zhou Daxi)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:82
msgid "玉 v3 佛陀"
msgstr "Yu v3 Buddha"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:86
