msgstr "Final version of Yu's guardian design (by: Zhou Daxi)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:89
msgid "Step 3 制作美术成品"
msgstr "Step 3: Producing the Final Artwork"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:91
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;当然设定稿的完成还不是游戏美术制作的全部。最后还需要制作补充了人物场景和动态，添加大量细节的立绘，以及制作做简化以及萌化后仍保留特点的可爱的Q版游戏小人。角色的美术制作才得以完成。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;制作立绘时，与画师团队讨论了以体现人物的神性为主题，所以先尝试了以体现宗教元素为主的设计。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Of course, completing the concept draft is not the entirety "
"of game art production. Finally, full illustrations supplementing "
"character scenes and dynamics with extensive details need to be produced,"
" along with cute chibi game sprites that are simplified and made adorable"
" while still retaining their distinctive features. Only then is the "
"character's art production complete.   &emsp;&emsp;When producing the "
"illustration, the artist team discussed using the expression of the "
"character's divinity as the theme, so they first tried a design primarily"
" featuring religious elements."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:95 ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:106
msgid "玉 立绘设计初稿"
msgstr "Yu Illustration Design Initial Draft"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:100
msgid "玉立绘的设计稿，体现宗教元素（by：玉不修）"
msgstr "Yu's illustration design draft, featuring religious elements (by: Yubuxiu)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:103
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;经过大家讨论后，认为想要体现民族文化创作主题，就应该让场景再结合傣族的生活地区特点，比如加上热带雨林环境的元素。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;After group discussion, it was decided that to reflect the "
"ethnic cultural creative theme, the scene should incorporate "
"characteristics of the Dai people's living areas, such as adding tropical"
" rainforest environment elements."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:111
msgid "玉立绘的设计稿（by：玉不修）"
msgstr "Yu's illustration design draft (by: Yubuxiu)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:114
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;最初设计玉小姐姐是悬浮在河流波光粼粼的水面上，最终玉不修老师考虑到配色效果的呈现，改成了像融化了成为了液态的土地。最终版的立绘终于被创作出来。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;The initial design had Miss Yu floating above a sparkling "
"river surface. Ultimately, Teacher Yubuxiu considered the color palette "
"presentation and changed it to what appears to be melted, liquid-like "
"earth. The final version of the illustration was finally created."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:117
msgid "玉 游戏立绘"
msgstr "Yu Game Illustration"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:122
msgid "玉在游戏里的立绘（by：玉不修）"
msgstr "Yu's in-game illustration (by: Yubuxiu)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:125
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;在双程老师对可可爱爱东西的创作力下，我们也有了游戏里使用的Q版玉的形象啦。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Thanks to Teacher Shuangcheng's creative talent for all "
"things cute, we now have the chibi version of Yu for use in the game."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:128
msgid "玉 游戏Q版"
msgstr "Yu Game Chibi"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/art-style.md:133
msgid "玉在游戏里的Q版形象（by：双程）"
msgstr "Yu's in-game chibi form (by: Shuangcheng)"

